<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/learning-objectives> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/editorialExplanation> "Supports alignment among instruction, competencies, assessment, and evidence." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-objectives/versions/1> .
