<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/learning-objectives> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: Short, clear statements describing what students are expected to learn or be able to do as a result of instruction or any learning activity. Prior to 2025, the descriptor \"Behavioral Objectives\" was used to index this subject." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-objectives/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/learning-objectives> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/Definition> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-objectives/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/learning-objectives> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Statements describing the knowledge, skills, or capabilities learners are expected to acquire or demonstrate through a learning activity." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/learning-objectives/versions/1> .
